b('Odds in favour and against?', 'If P(A) = m/(m + n): odds in favour ' + T('m : n') + ', odds against n : m. P(rain) = 0.2 → odds in favour 1 : 4')
b('Card facts to remember?', '52 cards, 4 suits × 13 ranks; 26 red and 26 black; 12 face cards (J, Q, K); 4 aces; 16 honour cards (10, J, Q, K, A) if asked. A hand of n cards: ⁵²Cₙ')
