b('Dice sums: which sum is most likely and how many ways for each sum 2 to 12?', T('7') + ' (6 ways). Ways: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1 for sums 2 through 12')
b('Coin sequences: P(exactly k heads in n tosses)?', r'\(\dfrac{\binom{n}{k}}{2^n}\)' + '. E.g. exactly 2 heads in 4 tosses: 6/16 = 3/8')
b('Birthday-type problems: P(all n people have different birthdays)?', r'\(\dfrac{365\cdot364\cdots(365-n+1)}{365^n}\)' + ': 1 − this is P(at least two share): for n = 23 it exceeds ½')

